  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Under the umbrella of UNESCO Global Education Coalition (GEC) and in line with UNESCO Strategy for TVET 2022-2029, the mission of the Global Skills Academy (GSA) has scaled up to support 10 million learners by 2029, connecting GEC Members to offer free high-quality training programs to improve employability skills toward more inclusive, sustainable, and resilient economies in a rapidly evolving and demanding labor market, leveraging the UNESCO-UNEVOC network. 

The JPO will contribute to the efficient implementation of the GSA mission in the framework of UNESCO Global Education Coalition.</narrative>
